      <Alias>posterMode</Alias>
      <Definition>92897bc6-a5f3-4ffe-ae27-f2e7e33dda49</Definition>
      <Type>Umbraco.TrueFalse</Type>
      <Mandatory>false</Mandatory>
      <Validation></Validation>
      <Description><![CDATA[For a finished campaign poster with its own text (set it as the background image, with a full description in "Image description"). Large screens: the poster fills the hero with no overlay and only the buttons show on it. Phones: the whole poster above the buttons. The slide's texts stay for screen readers and search engines; the right panel and the spinning mark are hidden.]]></Description>
